export const REGIONS = [{"id":"greenhollow","name":"Greenhollow","level":1},{"id":"copperwood","name":"Copperwood","level":19},{"id":"sunscar","name":"Sunscar Basin","level":37},{"id":"stormreach","name":"Stormreach","level":55},{"id":"starfall","name":"Starfall Expanse","level":73}];
export const xpForLevel = level => level <= 1 ? 0 : Math.floor(55 * Math.pow(level - 1, 2.05));
export function levelFromXp(xp){let l=1; while(l<99 && xp>=xpForLevel(l+1))l++; return l;}
export const titleCase = s => String(s||"").replaceAll("-"," ").replace(/\b\w/g,c=>c.toUpperCase());
